<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Sampo Jan-Sept net down 15 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Sampo Jan-Sept net down 15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-September 1996</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover			     14,323 vs 14,217</p>
<p>    Net profit				602 vs    711</p>
<p>NOTE - Sampo Corp is one of Taiwan's leading electronic product and electric appliance makers. The company said in a statement on Wednesday it has decided to lower its 1996 pretax profit forecast to T$704 million from an original projection of T$904 million due to a slugglish economy.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
